rain-core: xray/0048-muxcool-drain-close
Source: ReClash fix on top of xray/0037 (GPL-3.0), kept apart from the ported code.

A carrier that reached its lifetime is draining. Closing it hands the cause to
every session; each session's removeSession() then finds no sessions left and
closes again, so sync.Once.Do re-enters on the same goroutine and the close
never returns. A network drop on a draining carrier hung it for good.

Tests: TestDrainingCarrierCloseDoesNotDeadlock times out on the old condition.

